                                                "sense_id": "0ca4be0c-adc4-380d-a021-3e76e8591750",
                                                "text": "[…] That, Whereas your ſpacious Proemiums, and ſpecious Introductions of premis’d Perſpicuity in Prædication, both inveigle our Affections for the Meliorating of our Minds; […]"
